@startuml
title UML sequence behaviour — Keep a submission the API cannot take
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #667085
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}
actor "Visitor" as actor
box "Frontend — Jubilee Marketing" #E0F2FE
  participant "LaunchNotification or\nBusinessPreRegistration" as form
end box
box "Hosting — jubilee-to-www" #F4EBFF
  participant "server.js" as proxy
  database "KEEP_DIR\n/home/data/launch-kept" as kept
end box
box "Backend — Jubilee API" #D1FADF
  participant "StaffProxyMiddleware" as middleware
  participant "LaunchController" as controller
end box
box "Backend — Jubilee Application and Domain" #ECFDF3
  participant "Command handler" as handler
end box
box "Backend — Jubilee Infrastructure" #FFF4E5
  database "Jubilee database" as db
end box
actor -> form : Send a valid form
form -> proxy : POST /api/launch/notifications or /api/launch/businesses
proxy -> proxy : Read the body (at most 16 KB) and note the received time
proxy -> middleware : Forward with X-Jubilee-Received-At, Host of the API, the caller's address and the proxy key
alt The API answers 2xx, 400, 422 or 429
  middleware --> proxy : The answer
  proxy --> form : The same answer; nothing is kept
else No answer in 8 seconds, unreachable, 5xx, 401, 403, 404 or 408 (L2-218 AC8)
  alt Consent given, an e-mail address named and fewer than 1,000 kept
    proxy -> kept : Write one file: path, body, received time, caller's address
    proxy --> form : 202 Accepted with no body
    form --> actor : The confirmation, with focus
  else Otherwise
    proxy --> form : The API's answer, or 503
    form --> actor : "Still sending."; the page sends again every 5 seconds (L2-216 AC6, L2-217 AC6)
  end
end
== At start and every minute ==
proxy -> kept : List the kept submissions, oldest first
loop Each kept submission
  alt 12 months old
    proxy -> kept : Delete it unsent (L2-218 AC9)
  else
    proxy -> middleware : POST again with X-Jubilee-Received-At and X-Jubilee-Kept: true
    middleware -> middleware : Believe both only with the proxy key; remove them from the request
    middleware -> controller : Run the action; no bot challenge for a kept submission
    controller -> handler : Send the command with ReceivedAt
    handler -> db : Find the same sign-up (e-mail key) or pre-registration (e-mail key, name, received time)
    alt Already stored
      handler -> handler : Change nothing
    else New
      handler -> db : Save the row with ConsentedAt = received time, and the team's e-mail in the outbox
    end
    controller --> proxy : 202 Accepted
    proxy -> kept : Delete the file
  end
end
note over proxy, kept : A refusal as invalid removes the file and logs the count. 429 or a fault ends the round until the next minute. No log line holds personal data.
@enduml
